"User opens Account Info." = "用户打开“账户信息”。";
"User opens Set Up SMS." = "用户打开“设置 SMS”。";
"User signs in to Flexible Timers." = "用户登录 Flexible Timers。";
"Users can manage synchronization and activity-tracking features in the\n      app, sign out, remove local data from a device, delete XTimers data while\n      keeping Xin Account, delete the global Xin Account and every listed\n      product, and opt out of SMS by replying STOP. See the" = "用户可以在应用中管理同步和活动跟踪功能、退出登录、从设备中移除本地数据、在保留 Xin Account 的同时删除 XTimers 数据、删除全局 Xin Account 及列出的每个产品，还可以通过回复 STOP 选择不再接收 SMS。请参阅";
"Users may submit feedback anonymously or choose to attach it to their\n      signed-in account. XTimers stores the feedback text and operational\n      metadata needed to review the request, prevent abuse, and respond or fix\n      problems. Anonymous feedback is not attached to an account identifier,\n      although ordinary network request metadata may still be recorded." = "用户可以选择匿名提交反馈意见，或者将其与已登录的账户关联。 XTimers 存储用于审核请求、防止滥用以及处理或解决问题的反馈文本和相关操作元数据。 匿名反馈不会与账户标识相关联，\n尽管普通的网络请求元数据可能仍然会被记录。";
"Users opt in inside the Flexible Timers app by entering their phone number\n      and affirmatively checking a box that is not pre-selected. The checkbox\n      says: \"I agree to receive SMS verification codes and reminder messages\n      from Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC that I schedule for myself at this\n      phone number.\" The opt-in screen also displays these SMS Terms, the\n      Privacy Policy, standard message and data rate disclosure, STOP and HELP\n      instructions, message frequency information, and no-marketing language.\n      Consent is not a condition of purchase.\n      See the opt-in evidence page at" = "用户在 Flexible Timers 应用中输入电话号码，并主动选中默认未勾选的\n      复选框，即表示选择加入。复选框文字为：“我同意接收来自\n      Flexible Timers by Xintech LLC 的 SMS 验证码，以及我在此电话号码上\n      为自己安排的提醒消息。”选择加入屏幕还会显示这些 SMS 条款、\n      隐私政策、标准消息和数据费率说明、STOP 和 HELP 说明、消息频率\n      信息以及非营销说明。同意不是购买条件。\n      请参阅选择加入证据页面：";
"Website Analytics" = "网站分析";
"When a user connects XTimers to a Xin Account, XTimers processes a\n      separate XTimers account identifier, its Xin Account association, product\n      settings, and the contact email used for requested XTimers messages. When\n      the user enables SMS features, XTimers also processes a verified phone\n      number and SMS consent records. XTimers uses this product information to\n      synchronize XTimers data, deliver requested messages, prevent abuse, and\n      provide XTimers product support." = "当用户将 XTimers 连接到 Xin Account 时，XTimers 会处理单独的 XTimers 帐户标识符、该帐户与 Xin Account 的关联、产品设置以及用于发送用户所请求 XTimers 消息的联系电子邮件。当用户启用 SMS 功能时，XTimers 还会处理经过验证的电话号码和 SMS 同意记录。XTimers 使用这些产品信息来同步 XTimers 数据、发送用户所请求的消息、防止滥用并提供 XTimers 产品支持。";
"When the user enables automatic activity tracking, XTimers records\n      application activity on the user's Mac. Website-hostname tracking is\n      available only in the separately distributed XTimers Pro edition\n      (downloaded from xintechllc.com, not the App Store); it never applies to\n      the App Store edition. The underlying activity log is maintained on the\n      device and is not continuously uploaded. If the user explicitly emails or\n      publishes an activity report, the selected report content, including\n      application names (and, in XTimers Pro, website hostnames) shown in that\n      report, is sent to XTimers' service to perform the requested action." = "当用户启用自动活动跟踪时，XTimers 会记录用户 Mac 上的 App 活动。网站主机名跟踪仅在单独分发的 XTimers Pro 版本中提供（从 xintechllc.com 下载，而不是 App Store），绝不适用于 App Store 版本。底层活动日志保留在设备上，不会持续上传。如果用户明确通过电子邮件发送或发布活动报告，则所选报告内容（包括报告中显示的 App 名称，以及 XTimers Pro 中的网站主机名）会发送到 XTimers 服务，以执行所请求的操作。";
"When the user turns on the Personal Calendar Overlay and grants permission,\n      XTimers reads events from the calendars the user selects in Apple Calendar,\n      including any iCloud, Google, Outlook, or subscribed calendars already\n      configured there. XTimers does not connect to those calendar providers\n      directly and never requests their account credentials; Apple Calendar\n      continues to synchronize them under the user's own settings.\n      Event details are read on the device to display them and are not uploaded\n      to XTimers' service. XTimers stores only the user's on/off choice, the\n      identifiers of the calendars selected on that installation, and a record\n      of which privacy explanation was acknowledged. XTimers never creates,\n      edits, or deletes events in the user's calendars." = "当用户开启个人日历叠加层并授予权限后，XTimers 会读取用户在“日历”App 中所选日历里的日程，包括已在该 App 中配置的 iCloud、Google、Outlook 或订阅日历。XTimers 不会直接连接这些日历提供商，也绝不会索取其账户凭证；“日历”App 会继续按照用户自己的设置进行同步。系统会在设备上读取日程详细信息以供显示，这些信息不会上传到 XTimers 服务。XTimers 仅存储用户的开关选择、在本次安装中所选日历的标识符，以及一条关于已确认隐私说明版本的记录。XTimers 绝不会在用户的日历中创建、编辑或删除日程。";
"Wireless carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages." = "无线运营商对延迟或未送达的消息不承担任何责任。";
