"XTimers and Xin Account are operated by Xintech LLC. For identity,\n      recovery, product, deletion, or SMS support, email us at" = "XTimers 和 Xin Account 均由 Xintech LLC 运营。如需身份、恢复、产品、删除或 SMS 方面的支持，请发送电子邮件至";
"XTimers app screenshots" = "XTimers App 截图";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC Privacy Policy" = "Xintech LLC 运营的 XTimers 隐私政策";
"XTimers by Xintech LLC SMS is limited to account phone\n      verification codes and user-created reminder SMS sent only to the\n      signed-in user's own verified, opted-in account phone number. Reply STOP\n      to opt out of SMS messages. Reply HELP for help. Reply START or YES to\n      opt back in after consenting in the app. SMS is not a two-way chat\n      service." = "Xintech LLC 运营的 XTimers SMS 仅限账户电话号码验证码和用户创建的提醒 SMS，并且只会发送到已登录用户本人已验证且已选择接收的账户电话号码。回复 STOP 可退订 SMS 消息。回复 HELP 可获取帮助。在 App 中授权后，回复 START 或 YES 可重新选择接收。SMS 不是双向聊天服务。";
"XTimers currently sends email reports, verification messages, and\n      user-created reminders only to the signed-in user's own Xin Account email\n      address. SMS is sent only to the user's own verified, opted-in account\n      phone number. XTimers may process message content, delivery status,\n      scheduled time, and provider response metadata to deliver and troubleshoot\n      these messages." = "XTimers 目前仅将电子邮件报告、验证消息和用户创建的提醒发送到已登录用户自己的 Xin Account 电子邮件地址。SMS 仅发送到用户自己经过验证并已选择接收消息的帐户电话号码。XTimers 可能会处理消息内容、发送状态、计划时间和提供商响应元数据，以便发送这些消息并排查问题。";
"XTimers does not use the collected app data to track users across apps or\n      websites owned by other companies for advertising. Xintech LLC does not\n      sell SMS opt-in data or other app data. Xintech LLC does not share SMS\n      opt-in data, phone numbers, or text-message consent with third parties or\n      affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes." = "XTimers 不会使用所收集的 App 数据跨其他公司拥有的 App 或网站跟踪用户以投放广告。Xintech LLC 不会出售 SMS 选择接收数据或其他 App 数据。Xintech LLC 不会出于营销或推广目的，与第三方或关联公司共享 SMS 选择接收数据、电话号码或短信授权信息。";
"XTimers email reports and email messages are currently limited to the\n      signed-in user's own Xin Account email address." = "XTimers 电子邮件报告和电子邮件消息目前仅发送到已登录用户自己的 Xin Account 电子邮件地址。";
"XTimers for Mac" = "XTimers Mac 版";
"XTimers home" = "XTimers 首页";
"XTimers iPad screenshot" = "XTimers iPad 截图";
"XTimers iPad timer list in light mode" = "浅色模式下的 XTimers iPad 计时器列表";
"XTimers iPhone screenshot" = "XTimers iPhone 截图";
"XTimers iPhone timer list in light mode" = "浅色模式下的 XTimers iPhone 计时器列表";
"XTimers is a calm Apple-native timer workspace for timers, countdowns, clocks, task sets, reports, custom sounds, and account reminders across Mac, iPhone, and iPad." = "XTimers 是适用于 Mac、iPhone 和 iPad 的 Apple 原生计时工作区，支持计时器、倒计时、时钟、任务集、报告、自定义声音和账号提醒。";
"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC and uses Xin Account for shared\n      sign-in. This policy explains the information processed for Xin Account\n      identity services and for XTimers timers, countdowns, activity tracking,\n      synchronization, reports, custom sounds, reminders, support, and\n      messaging features." = "XTimers 由 Xintech LLC 运营，并使用 Xin Account 进行共享登录。本政策说明了为 Xin Account 身份服务以及 XTimers 的计时器、倒计时、活动跟踪、同步、报告、自定义声音、提醒、支持和消息功能所处理的信息。";
"XTimers macOS add countdown sheet in light mode" = "浅色模式下的 XTimers macOS 添加倒计时表单";
"XTimers macOS add timer sheet in light mode" = "浅色模式下的 XTimers macOS 添加计时器表单";
"XTimers macOS expanded double-column timer window" = "XTimers macOS 展开的双栏计时器窗口";
"XTimers macOS main timer window in light mode" = "浅色模式下的 XTimers macOS 主计时器窗口";
"XTimers may process a per-installation device identifier, push-notification\n      token, platform, app version, build number, operating-system version,\n      device model, service command or feature interaction, response status,\n      response duration, and error information. These records are used to\n      provide synchronization and notifications, operate the service, measure\n      feature use, diagnose failures, improve performance, and prevent abuse." = "XTimers 可能会处理每次安装的设备标识符、推送通知令牌、平台、App 版本、构建号、操作系统版本、设备型号、服务命令或功能交互、响应状态、响应时长和错误信息。这些记录用于提供同步和通知、运行服务、衡量功能使用情况、诊断故障、提升性能并防止滥用。";
"XTimers platforms" = "XTimers 平台";
"XTimers receives the IP address and user-agent information used to connect\n      to its service. For security, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and\n      service administration, the service may retain the IP address, a derived\n      IP key, approximate country, region, city, postal area, network\n      organization, request time, command name, and a stable hashed account\n      identifier for authenticated requests. The app also submits Apple\n      MetricKit diagnostic payloads that can contain crash, hang, CPU, disk,\n      energy, and other performance or technical information." = "XTimers 会接收用于连接其服务的 IP 地址和 User-Agent 信息。为保障安全、排查故障、防止滥用和管理服务，服务可能会保留 IP 地址、派生 IP 键、大致的国家、地区、城市、邮政区域、网络组织、请求时间、命令名称，以及用于已验证请求的稳定哈希账户标识符。App 还会提交 Apple MetricKit 诊断有效载荷，其中可能包含崩溃、卡顿、CPU、磁盘、能耗以及其他性能或技术信息。";
"XTimers uses a Xin Account to identify and authenticate a user. A Xin\n      Account is the shared identity layer for XTimers and any other connected\n      products listed in the account controls; it is not an XTimers product\n      account and does not contain XTimers timers, reports, sounds, or SMS data." = "XTimers 使用 Xin Account 来识别用户并验证其身份。Xin Account 是 XTimers 以及帐户控件中列出的其他任何已连接产品的共享身份层；它不是 XTimers 产品帐户，也不包含 XTimers 计时器、报告、声音或 SMS 数据。";
"XTimers uses your Xin Account for shared sign-in while XTimers keeps your timers, reports, settings, sounds, and SMS choices as XTimers product data." = "XTimers 使用您的 Xin Account 进行共享登录，同时将您的计时器、报告、设置、声音和 SMS 选择作为 XTimers 产品数据单独保存。";
"XTimers — Mac, iPhone, and iPad" = "XTimers — Mac、iPhone 和 iPad";
"Xin Account Identity and Recovery" = "Xin Account 身份和恢复";
"Xin Account Identity and Sign-In" = "Xin Account 身份和登录";
"Xin Account identity data is retained while needed to provide the shared\n      identity and connected-product associations. XTimers product data is\n      retained while needed to provide the connected XTimers account and its\n      requested features. Published report content is unavailable after its\n      selected expiration and is removed by service cleanup. Message and\n      consent records may be retained as needed for delivery, troubleshooting,\n      abuse prevention, and carrier or legal compliance." = "Xin Account 身份数据会在提供共享身份及已连接产品关联所需的期间内保留。XTimers 产品数据会在提供已连接 XTimers 帐户及其所请求功能所需的期间内保留。已发布的报告内容会在所选到期时间后不可用，并由服务清理流程移除。消息和同意记录可能会根据发送、故障排除、防止滥用以及遵守运营商或法律要求的需要予以保留。";
"Xin Account processes an account identifier, email address,\n      authentication and session records, linked sign-in provider records,\n      recovery and security records, account lifecycle records, and the\n      association between the Xin Account and each connected product account.\n      Xintech LLC uses this information to authenticate the user, secure and\n      recover the account, manage sessions and linked providers, authorize\n      connected-product access, prevent abuse, and provide identity support." = "Xin Account 会处理帐户标识符、电子邮件地址、身份验证和会话记录、关联登录提供商记录、恢复和安全记录、帐户生命周期记录，以及 Xin Account 与每个已连接产品帐户之间的关联。Xintech LLC 使用这些信息来验证用户身份、保护和恢复帐户、管理会话和关联提供商、授权访问已连接产品、防止滥用并提供身份支持。";
"Xin Account sign-in. XTimers data stays separate." = "使用 Xin Account 登录。XTimers 数据保持独立。";
"Xintech LLC uses administrative, technical, and organizational measures\n      intended to protect XTimers information. No storage or transmission system\n      can be guaranteed to be completely secure." = "Xintech LLC 采用管理、技术和组织措施来保护 XTimers 信息。任何存储或传输系统都无法保证绝对安全。";
"Xintech LLC uses service providers for identity and authentication, cloud\n      hosting and storage, email and SMS delivery, push notifications,\n      diagnostics, and website analytics. These providers may process\n      information only as needed to perform services for Xintech LLC, subject\n      to their applicable terms and privacy safeguards. Email and SMS providers\n      receive the recipient, requested message content, and delivery metadata\n      needed to send the user's message." = "Xintech LLC 使用服务提供商来提供身份和身份验证、云托管和存储、电子邮件和 SMS 发送、推送通知、诊断以及网站分析服务。这些提供商只能在为 Xintech LLC 提供服务所需的范围内处理信息，并须遵守其适用条款和隐私保障。电子邮件和 SMS 提供商会收到发送用户消息所需的收件人信息、用户所请求的消息内容和发送元数据。";
"Your Xin Account identifies you and authorizes each connected XTimers account." = "您的 Xin Account 会识别您的身份，并授权每个已连接的 XTimers 帐户。";
